                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "typeName": "notesText",
            "multiple": false,
            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": "Additional documentation and metadata can be found in the file \"Data report Broeder Scarcity version 13-06-22.pdf\". \n\nMethod: Online questionnaire with Qualtrics. Universe: An experimental survey is carried out with two conditions for a product offer in a web store: an offer with a limited-time availability notice; and an offer with a non-limited (in-stock) notice. In total, 208 Europeans (originating from Italy, an individualistic-masculine society, and the Netherlands, an individualistic-feminine society) participated in the study."
